{"t":"Iksupan","s":"iksupan-218de","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Iks_Aucar_9bb6f7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p></div><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Iksupan</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Iks Aucar\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iks_Aucar_9bb6f7.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Entered through a secret passage in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32727,32876,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32727, 32876, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">150</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">150</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">150</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.10.12852<br/>November 28, 2022<br/>Winter Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Iksupan is the \"Lost city of Gold\", home of the now-undead Iks. \n</p><p>Access to Iksupan is obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/adventures-of-galthen-quest\">Adventures of Galthen Quest</a>.  \n</p><p>The city is comprised of \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan%20Last%20Stand\">Iksupan Last Stand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan%20Occupied%20Sanctuary\">Iksupan Occupied Sanctuary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan%20Undercity\">Iksupan Undercity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan%20Waterways\">Iksupan Waterways</a></li></ul>\n<p>Iksupan seems to be an Allusion of Eldorado. It also features a reference to the Nazca lines resembling the Hummingbird geoglyph. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Ape\"><img alt=\"Cursed Ape\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Ape_79bd59.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Ape\">Cursed Ape</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\">Banana</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Kongra's Shoulderpad (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Armor\">Plate Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ape%20Fur\">Ape Fur</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Po